     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">Dear All,</span><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">I have setup the RDS MySQL instance in amazon. I am able to connect from my local pc to amazon rds instance and display results, but when I deploy in <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362579563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jLmlMJPdgMLhFMkuiEA3O\">shinyapps.io</a> . I get below error:</span></font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;white-space:pre-wrap\">Failed to connect to database: Error: Can&#39;t connect to MySQL server on &#39;<a href=\"http://mysqlrealtimeanalytics.csfwhddjumf9.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mysqlrealtimeanalytics.csfwhddjumf9.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362579563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1hOLbEmtAzOgLeOBrFrtNW\">mysqlrealtimeanalytics.csfwhddjumf9.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com</a>&#39; (110)</span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></font><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><b>I tried below steps from below link nothing worked out.</b></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><a href=\"https://www.rstudio.com/faq-items/how-do-i-give-access-to-my-rds-instance-for-an-application-i-have-deployed-on-shinyapps-io/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rstudio.com/faq-items/how-do-i-give-access-to-my-rds-instance-for-an-application-i-have-deployed-on-shinyapps-io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362579563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PGihk50xEW-_PmlRPJhzW\">https://www.rstudio.com/faq-items/how-do-i-give-access-to-my-rds-instance-for-an-application-i-have-deployed-on-shinyapps-io/</a> to add the shinyapps account id to aws </div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">From the above link mentioned in point 2 it is mentioned to go to Security Groups. When I go there I am getting below message</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(17,102,187);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\">Your account does not support the EC2-Classic Platform in this region. DB Security Groups are only needed when the EC2-Classic Platform is supported. Instead, use VPC Security Groups to control access to your DB Instances. </span><a href=\"https://us-west-2.console.aws.amazon.com/ec2/home?region=us-west-2#s=SecurityGroups\" style=\"color:rgb(20,110,180);font-weight:bold;border-radius:2px;padding:1px 2px;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://us-west-2.console.aws.amazon.com/ec2/home?region%3Dus-west-2%23s%3DSecurityGroups&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362579563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0FCwaPj5AkgrWCDHWoT2rB\">Go to the EC2 Console</a><span style=\"color:rgb(17,102,187);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\"> to view and manage your VPC Security Groups. For more information, see </span><a href=\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-supported-platforms.html\" style=\"color:rgb(20,110,180);font-weight:bold;border-radius:2px;padding:1px 2px;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-supported-platforms.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362579563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SvQDBfRlf36n9fR2cr2Sw\">AWS Documentation on Supported Platforms</a><span style=\"color:rgb(17,102,187);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\"> and </span><a href=\"http://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/USER_VPC.html\" style=\"color:rgb(20,110,180);font-weight:bold;border-radius:2px;padding:1px 2px;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/USER_VPC.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792362579563000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2RXtzUTNh7IEL_yKiNph_B\">Using RDS in VPC</a><span style=\"color:rgb(17,102,187);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\">.&quot;</span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(17,102,187);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Roboto,Arial,&#39;Droid Sans&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\">I tried to goto VPC Security Groups and I have selected the database as mentioned in point 5 : In connection type there is no EC2 Security Group there is no option to add the account id as well. </span></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\">Please suggest am I in right direction please tell if anywhere am I going wrong.</span></font></div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\">Please check the attachments for my aws rds settings .</span></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:18.2px;background-color:rgb(239,249,255)\"><br></span></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Roboto, Arial, Droid Sans, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-he